{
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "A barman in Naples made his empty caf\u00e9 famous all over the world, with one hair he picked off an airplane seat.",
   "s": 0.06,
   "e": 5.791
  },
  {
   "text": "His name is Gennaro, and his caf\u00e9 is so quiet that even the flies have stopped coming in.",
   "s": 5.851,
   "e": 10.47
  },
  {
   "text": "One night he's flying home from Milan, and the man asleep in the seat in front of him is Diego Maradona.",
   "s": 10.53,
   "e": 16.163
  },
  {
   "text": "In Naples, that's like sitting behind a saint.",
   "s": 16.224,
   "e": 18.23
  },
  {
   "text": "Gennaro is far too shy to say hello. So for two hours, he just stares at the back of that famous, curly head.",
   "s": 18.29,
   "e": 24.262
  },
  {
   "text": "The plane lands. Maradona walks off. And there, on the headrest, lies one single black hair.",
   "s": 24.322,
   "e": 29.278
  },
  {
   "text": "Gennaro looks left. He looks right. And he slips it into his wallet.",
   "s": 29.338,
   "e": 32.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Back at the caf\u00e9, he puts it in a little golden frame, with candles and flowers.",
   "s": 32.8,
   "e": 36.954
  },
  {
   "text": "His wife says: Gennaro, it's a hair.",
   "s": 37.014,
   "e": 38.929
  },
  {
   "text": "But the next morning, an old lady walks in, and kneels in front of it. By lunchtime, the queue goes around the block.",
   "s": 38.989,
   "e": 44.975
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait. Why would a whole city pray to a hair?",
   "s": 45.035,
   "e": 46.886
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, before Maradona, Naples had never won the league. Not once. With him, they won it twice.",
   "s": 46.946,
   "e": 52.108
  },
  {
   "text": "To them, he wasn't a footballer. He was a miracle. And every miracle needs a relic.",
   "s": 52.168,
   "e": 56.395
  },
  {
   "text": "More than thirty years later, the hair is still on that wall.",
   "s": 56.455,
   "e": 59.145
  },
  {
   "text": "And if you want a photo, there's only one rule. First, you buy a coffee.",
   "s": 59.205,
   "e": 62.578
  }
 ],
